      "comment": "Havria: Yinyuan Hall's version of the story",
      "content": "Yinyuan Hall, the salt trade of the Eight Trades, remembers Havria as a god who was assassinated by Morax out of envy. Wanyan, a hall member posing as an archaeologist in Sal Flore, wanted proof of this. Zhongli's contract and the ruin's evidence led her to a different truth, and she left unable to accept it.",
